ptions","key":{"work_id":607,"language":"nl"},"before":null,"after":{"work_id":607,"language":"nl","bound_author_id":365,"text":"In Boston worden vrouwen vermoord door iemand die over opvallende medische kennis lijkt te beschikken. Rechercheurs Thomas Moore en Jane Rizzoli zoeken naar het verband tussen de slachtoffers. Hun onderzoek leidt naar arts Catherine Cordell, die eerder een gewelddadige aanval overleefde. De nieuwe dader lijkt haar verleden te kennen en richt zijn aandacht op haar. De politie moet uitzoeken hoe die kennis mogelijk is en voorkomen dat een vroegere bedreiging in een andere vorm terugkeert.","source_type":"official_catalog","source_name":"Gecontroleerde boek- en catalogusbronnen","source_url":"https://www.bibliotheek.nl/catalogus/titel.412356724.html/de-chirurg/","evidence":[{"type":"reviewed_identity_and_bibliography","sources":["http://data.bibliotheken.nl/id/nbt/p42284117X"],"reference":"work:607","checked_at":"2026-11-02T18:09:00.000Z","note":"Exact2019Dutch paperback9789044358490 is independently listed by Bibliotheek. Prefer its verified334x500cover over enlarging the older2009printing131x200cover. Existing Surgeon2001Work retained; Christine Marshall is not the author.","supplemental":null},{"type":"original_substantive_source_review","review":"content-review-019.json","sources":["https://www.bibliotheek.nl/catalogus/titel.412356724.html/de-chirurg/","https://openlibrary.org/works/OL14871640W","https://data.bibliotheken.nl/id/nbt/p42284117X"]},{"type":"cover_front_review","cover_id":15174409,"sha256":"ec5451d33d562d0591d263f0c644254332283b0d6659526ea4c5981b41c994f5","reference":"cover-semantic-review-007.json","limitation":"Front Tess Gerritsen, De Chirurg, House of Books logo and sink/blood design. Same source2019Dutch paperbackISBN9789044358490 independently corroborated by Bibliotheek exactprinting. Prefer this334x500cover to enlarging older131x200printing image. Front does not show ISBN barcode."}],"provenance":"original_source_revi